{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"AI Document Synthesis, PRD, & PPTX Service","description":"\n# AI Document Synthesis, PRD, & PPTX Microservice 🚀\n\nMicroservice berbasis FastAPI yang mengorkestrasi konversi dokumen riset produk (Word, PowerPoint, Excel, PDF), \npemrosesan AI (LLM *OpenAI-compatible*), dan otomatisasi pembuatan presentasi PowerPoint (.pptx).\n\n### 🛠️ Fitur Utama:\n- **API 1: Document to Synthesis (`POST /api/v1/synthesize`)**: Ekstraksi & sintesis dokumen riset multidokumen ke Markdown.\n- **API 2: Synthesis to PRD (`POST /api/v1/generate-prd`)**: Pembuatan dokumen PRD komprehensif berstandar industri dengan RAGFlow file ID.\n- **API 3: PRD to PPTX (`POST /api/v1/generate-pptx`)**: Pembuatan file presentasi PowerPoint 16:9 modern.\n- **API 4: End-to-End Pipeline (`POST /api/v1/pipeline`)**: Eksekusi seluruh alur sekaligus.\n- **API 5: Skills Management (`/api/v1/skills`)**: Melihat, mengganti (*replace*), dan me-reset panduan `SKILL.md` (PRD, PPTX, Synthesis) secara dinamis via API.\n- **RAGFlow Files Integration (`POST & GET /api/v1/files`)**: Otomatis mengunggah dan mengunduh seluruh artefak langsung dari RAGFlow.\n    ","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/v1/synthesize":{"post":{"summary":"Konversi Dokumen Riset Mentah & Susun Dokumen Sintesis","description":"Menerima upload dokumen (.docx, .pptx, .xlsx, .pdf, .txt, .md), mengekstrak isi ke Markdown, upload ke RAGFlow, mengekstrak insight AI, dan menghasilkan dokumen Sintesis Riset. [Membutuhkan Authorization: Bearer <secret-token>]","operationId":"synthesize_documents_api_v1_synthesize_post","requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Body_synthesize_documents_api_v1_synthesize_post"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SynthesizeResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/synthesize/text":{"post":{"summary":"Sintesis dari Teks / Markdown Langsung","operationId":"synthesize_text_api_v1_synthesize_text_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SynthesizeJsonRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SynthesizeResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/generate-prd":{"post":{"summary":"Menyusun Product Requirement Document (PRD) dari Sintesis Riset di RAGFlow","description":"Mengunduh Markdown sintesis riset dari RAGFlow via GET /api/v1/files/{ragflow_file_id}, menjalankan PRD Generation Skill aktif, dan mengunggah PRD ke RAGFlow. [Membutuhkan Authorization: Bearer <secret-token>]","operationId":"generate_prd_api_v1_generate_prd_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GeneratePRDRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GeneratePRDResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/generate-pptx":{"post":{"summary":"Menghasilkan Presentasi PowerPoint (.pptx) Visual dari PRD di RAGFlow","description":"Mengunduh Markdown PRD dari RAGFlow via GET /api/v1/files/{ragflow_file_id}, mengekstrak struktur slide dengan PPTX Skill aktif, merender ke 16:9 .pptx in-memory, dan mengunggah ke RAGFlow. [Membutuhkan Authorization: Bearer <secret-token>]","operationId":"generate_pptx_api_v1_generate_pptx_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GeneratePPTXRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GeneratePPTXResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/pipeline":{"post":{"summary":"End-to-End Pipeline: Raw Docs -> Synthesis -> PRD -> PPTX","description":"Mengorkestrasi seluruh alur kerja mulai dari file mentah hingga presentasi PowerPoint dalam satu kali request. [Membutuhkan Authorization: Bearer <secret-token>]","operationId":"full_pipeline_api_v1_pipeline_post","requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Body_full_pipeline_api_v1_pipeline_post"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FullPipelineResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/download/{identifier}":{"get":{"summary":"Download File Artefak (.md / .pptx / .docx / .json)","description":"Mengunduh file artefak. Jika file tidak ada di storage lokal, service otomatis mem-proxy stream langsung dari RAGFlow.","operationId":"download_file_api_v1_download__identifier__get","parameters":[{"name":"identifier","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Identifier"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/health":{"get":{"summary":"Health Check API","operationId":"health_check_api_v1_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{